[IDD_WPAWN]
	
	"A pawn can move forward only one square at a time"
	"except on the first move when a pawn may move forward"
	"2 squares. A pawn may be attacked if it chooses to move"
	"these two squares as if it took two turns to move to the"
	"new square. Pawns attack only diagonally forward."


[IDD_WROOK]	

	"A Rook may may move any number of squares horizontally or"
	"vertically but not diagonally."


[IDD_WKNIGHT]	

	"A Knight moves two squares in one direction (not diagonally)"
	"followed by one square in another (also not diagonally)."
		
[IDD_WBISHOP]	

	"A Bishop may move any number of squares in any non blocked"
	"diagonal direction."



